---
---
<section class="py-16 px-6 relative z-10" id="simulation">
  <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-8 reveal">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-on-surface mb-2">Simulasi Percakapan LISA</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-outline">Lihat betapa cepat dan ramahnya LISA menjawab pertanyaan lingkungan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 bg-white dark:bg-surface-container rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xl border border-outline-variant/30 space-y-4">
      <!-- User message -->
      <div class="flex justify-end">
        <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-2xl rounded-br-xs px-4 py-2.5 max-w-[80%] text-sm shadow-sm">
          Kak LISA, botol plastik bekas enaknya diapain ya? 🤔
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bot message -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
        <img alt="LISA Avatar" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-primary/20 shrink-0" width="32" height="32" src="/images/lisa-avatar.webp" />
        <div class="bg-surface dark:bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/30 text-on-surface rounded-2xl rounded-tl-xs p-4 max-w-[85%] text-sm space-y-2">
          <p>Hai! Botol plastik (PET) bisa kamu kelola dengan 3 cara keren ini:</p>
          <ol class="chat-ol !my-2">
            <li><strong>Cuci & Remas:</strong> Keringkan lalu remas agar hemat tempat di tempat sampah daur ulang.</li>
            <li><strong>Setor ke Bank Sampah:</strong> Bisa dapat saldo tabungan atau poin rewards lho! 💰</li>
            <li><strong>Upcycling DIY:</strong> Ubah jadi pot tanaman gantung mini untuk kelas/kamar.</li>
          </ol>
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="/chat" class="quick-reply-btn">
              <span>📍 Cari Bank Sampah Terdekat</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="pt-2 text-center">
        <a href="/chat" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-primary hover:underline">
          <span>Coba chat langsung sekarang</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
